"<strong>Work out drop {#} by hand.</strong> With <strong>Blind</strong> still ticked, do Analysis {#} now: read \\(\\eta\\), \\(\\lambda\\), the air density and the oil density from the Readouts. Then untick <strong>Blind</strong> (leave the other box ticked) and compare your \\(r\\) and \\(q\\) with the table’s.",
